    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hurt, lesion</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Acut.</u>
				54
			</span></i>, al.: generally, <i>mischief, injury</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.65
			</span></i>; <i>blemish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PGnom.
				205
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things, <i>mischief, bane, plague</i>, used by <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> alone of Trag., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέπει ς</span>.
				<i>the mischief</i> is revealed, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				389
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐσθημάτων</span>
			<i>ruin</i> to them, ib.<i><span class="en">
				561
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πολυκτόνον</span>, of Helen,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				734
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>pest</i>, of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστήρ</span> (star-fish), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				548a9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πρὸς εὐκαρπίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					2.7.5
				</span></i>
			.—
				Ion.
			 word, very rare in 
				Att.
			 Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				4.11
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> Il.cc., <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				653
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑνεα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Al.</u>
				231
			</span></i>.]</div>
